# Python dev artifacts — must never enter an image. `COPY apps/api` would
# otherwise ship a local .venv (with its own, possibly-stale dependency tree)
# and the gitignored generated prisma-client into the FastAPI image, bloating
# it and tripping the container CVE scan on packages the app never runs.
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
apps/api/prisma-client
